    "show_share": true,
    "description": "AKU hosted its third hackathon on the 17 th , 18 th  and 23 rd  of February 2018. Organised by the departments of UGME and PGME, in consultation with Critical Creative Innovative Thinking (CCIT) Forum, HackMedEd was a two and a half day event where people from various professions such as medicine, nursing, IT, business and engineering came together in cross-sector cooperation for a single cause - to make medical education in Pakistan better.",
